Becoming.Downstream.balances : Becoming.Downstream.flow.Balances Becoming.Downstream.web
Becoming.Downstream.dependent : Becoming.Downstream.web.Dependent
Becoming.Downstream.one_way : Becoming.Downstream.flow.Balances Becoming.Downstream.web ∧
